Z||000002||maryjane||08-12-2001||03:07 AM||||Yeah, out here they're not bad in summer, but in the winter when the only grass growing is near the hiway, watch out. I counted over 80 one night in 75 miles just on my side of the road.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Wolfhound||08-12-2001||07:06 AM||||We have an estimated population of 30 per square mile. I,ve yet to hit one with a Fiero but I drive at night with extream caution. The 2 mile stretch between here and town averages about 3 a week.||||reg||1
Z||000004||DecadenceR||08-12-2001||07:55 AM||||I live right by a resivor (sp?) and I happen to drive past it late at nigt sometimes. I always see at least 4 deer there, and that's only what you get to see in the small clearing. God knows how many more are there. But last week I sucessfully dodged one. Missed it by about an inch.||||reg||1
