Z||000011||FieroJoe||08-12-2001||11:10 PM||||My Fiero's hit at least 2 deer in its life I beleive.  None when I was driving, all previous owner.<P>Otherwise, I know all the spots around my house where the deer like to cross, so I always slow down and watch for brown eyes flashing on the side of the road.<P>They taste good too, but not the roadkill ones.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joesig_1.jpg"> <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87||||reg||1
