Z||000014||AusFiero||08-13-2001||09:18 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by rogergarrison:<BR><B>No they dont. Hiway Patrol here did some kind of test/survey. Just yet another gimick to get your money.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You mean they went out slaying deer in patrol cars to find this out Roger?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>We only have deer on a farm here. Bred to die basically. So by the time your that far off the road up the side of the mountain you would probably be hoping to hit one and slow you down before reaching the cliff face.<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
